 the hell.\n\nHow many floors you dominate, more close you going to be a King Of Hell\n\nYou need to use hand movements to cast magic, your abilities and memory define casting speed and your success. This is not easy! But I believe in your abilities!", "short_description": "Turn your fantasies into reality! In King Of Hell, you can cast magics, build towers, summon allies, and\nmuch more!"}]}, "developer_name": "Mimic.Land", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.caiohv.com/kohprivacypolice", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Mimic.Land", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://caiohv.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "275629210202852"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ACTION", "ADVENTURE", "HORROR"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8200820640009359"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974753_352136499798659_1346251698684454213_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rCbzp-UIsrIQ7kNvwE1lTJr&_nc_oc=AdqqjHYnr_-p-ZIQg6fFywM1Ui3YO2koQvSTXLKxgvbjdg-W2YjcEzSPHXgHceTkdVg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOe1AMB4uah-EHQLjN_YiV-c-SIaYKVk0xeFvTBxvULpw&oe=6ADCDB31"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "King Of Hell - Prototype Version", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_cat